==Battleground==
*3 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*2 [[Zuche]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Miss Haka]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Fallen Bear]] spawns.
**1 [[Zapy]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**3 [[Coffin Zoge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Midnite D.]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
**2 [[Zuche]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 60~66.67 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Try to kill the last Sinner Snache with a [[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Boulder Cat]] or just stall Sinner Snache with only [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cat]], once you will have full money, start spawning cats. When Miss Haka spawns, wait for Zapy, because you can do damage to Zapy and Miss Haka with the [[Ototo Corps#Holy Blast|Holy Blast]]. Do not kill Coffin Zoges, because [[Pied Piper Cat (Rare Cat)|Brass Cat]] can create a [[Wave Attack|Mini-Wave]] and Pierce Fallen Bear and Midnite D's shields, thanks to Coffin Zoge. Once Fallen Bear is gone, start focusing on Miss Haka, once Miss Haka is dead, you don't need to worry anymore, Midnite D. and Zapy are no longer a threat.

==Trivia==
*Poetic Death may be a reference to the [[wikipedia:Death poem|death poem]] genre of poetry.

